<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Thursday that Corimon SACA and Buenos Aires Embotelladora SA were unavailable for after-hours trading.</p>
